wisper ships with a "Powered by wisper" notice in the panel's footer, linking to the
repository above.

That notice is not a licence condition - Apache 2.0 asks you to carry this NOTICE file
with the software, and nothing more. It is there because somebody looking at a hosting
panel should be able to find out what it is built on, and because it is how a project
like this is found at all. Keeping it is appreciated rather than required, and if you
would rather it said something else, the component that renders it is
`panel/frontend/src/shell/PoweredBy.tsx`.
